  "weak_areas": [
    "Typing accuracy: use Tab completion (several typos caused 'command not found')",
    "Reading before/after evidence in incidents (read Incident 2B in reverse at first)",
    "Finishing answers: convert raw values into the unit a person needs (kB → GB)",
    "Absolute paths must start with / (wrote opt/app/backups)",
    "Relative paths in cp/mv: FROM and TO both count from where you stand (check pwd first)",
    "rm safety: a wrong relative path deletes something ELSE, and rm -rf never warns — use pwd, ls, absolute paths",
    "echo without > only prints; echo \"text\" > file saves (missed twice)",
    "Quotes must be in pairs: an odd number leaves a > prompt waiting (happened twice)"
  ],
